Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — individual review draft
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-09-28
Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

INT. CASH HOTEL ROOM - NIGHT

Blank drives, an offline laptop and a table cleared of everything else. Zoe keeps the original. Elias makes working copies with her permission and separates them.

They find placement, monitor, recover and exception fields. Numbers connect her folder to routes and transactions, but no row explains itself. Zoe writes beside a code: AC019 — probably Mac. PROVE IT.

ELIAS
We could show someone all of it.

ZOE
All the children in it? Their routes and names? We need one thing someone outside this can check.

He steps back from the keyboard. Zoe chooses the next question.
